      },
      {
        "answer": "The yield is only 32%, which is significantly lower than the theoretical yield, indicating losses during the process.",
        "question": "Why is the narrator disappointed with the yield of the reaction?"
      },
      {
        "answer": "Sodium carbonate is used to neutralize the sulfuric acid, making the mixture safer to handle and dispose of.",
        "question": "What is the purpose of adding sodium carbonate to the mixture?"
      }
